   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The data is clean and ready to be joined to the target created from the monthly performance data. The same cleaning process will be placed into a function so it can be applied to all origination datasets coming from Freddie Mac's standardized files.\n",
    "\n",
    "------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "## Data Load & Clean- Performance"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "id": "21fd6dc4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| error: false\n",
    "#| warning: false\n",
    "\n",
    "#-- performance load--\n",
    "perf_2018= pd.read_csv(\"~/projects/data/homeloanadvisor/historical_data_time_2018Q1.txt\", sep=\"|\", header=None, na_values=[\"\", \"9999\", \"999\", \"   \", \"X\"], low_memory=False)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cf11b89f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "For the performance file, `\"9\"` was not included in the missing value list because `zero_balance_code = 9` is a real category. It represents REO disposition."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "b3c98322",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#-- performance column names--\n",
    "perf_2018.columns= [\"loan_id\", \"report_period\", \"current_upb\", \"delinquency_status\", \"loan_age\", \"remaining_months\", \"defect_settlement_date\", \"modification_flag\", \"zero_balance_code\", \"zero_balance_effective_date\", \"current_rate\", \"current_deferred_upb\", \"ddlpi\", \"mi_recoveries\", \"net_sales_proceeds\", \"non_mi_recoveries\", \"expenses\", \"legal_costs\", \"maintenance_costs\", \"taxes_insurance\", \"misc_expenses\", \"actual_loss\", \"modification_cost\", \"step_modification_flag\", \"deferred_payment_plan\", \"eltv\", \"zero_balance_removal_upb\", \"delinquent_accrued_interest\", \"disaster_delinquency\", \"borrower_assistance\", \"current_month_mod_cost\", \"interest_bearing_upb\"]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4baf34c6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Only the fields needed to construct the target variable and summarize the loan termination outcome were kept. The performance file contains repeated monthly rows for each loan, so it cannot be merged directly to the origination file without creating duplicate loan rows."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "dd53e867",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#-- keeping needed performance variables--\n",
    "keeping= [\"loan_id\", \"report_period\", \"delinquency_status\", \"zero_balance_code\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "perf_2018= perf_2018[keeping].copy()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c334a532",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Encoding\n",
    "\n",
    "The categorical variables will be mapped for interpretation. `zero_balance_code` is mapped to a readable label, while `delinquency_status` is converted into the target variable."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "6538192b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#-- delinquency map--\n",
    "delinquency_map= {\n",
    "    \"0\": \"Current or <30 Days Delinquent\",\n",
    "    \"1\": \"30-59 Days Delinquent\",\n",
    "    \"2\": \"60-89 Days Delinquent\",\n",
    "    \"3\": \"90-119 Days Delinquent\",\n",
    "    \"4\": \"120-149 Days Delinquent\",\n",
    "    \"5\": \"150-179 Days Delinquent\",\n",
    "    \"6\": \"180-209 Days Delinquent\",\n",
    "    \"RA\": \"REO Acquisition\"\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "#-- zero balance map--\n",
    "zero_balance_map= {\n",
    "    1.0: \"Prepaid or Matured\",\n",
    "    2.0: \"Third Party Sale\",\n",
    "    3.0: \"Short Sale or Charge Off\",\n",
    "    9.0: \"REO Disposition\",\n",
    "    15.0: \"Whole Loan Sale\",\n",
    "    16.0: \"Reperforming Loan Securitization\",\n",
    "    96.0: \"Defect Prior to Termination\"\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "perf_2018[\"zero_balance_label\"]= perf_2018[\"zero_balance_code\"].map(zero_balance_map).fillna(\"Not Applicable\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "713461bd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We'll use the industry standard \"90+ days delinquent\". The goal is to estimate the probability that a loan becomes 90 or more days delinquent at any point during the observed performance history."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "84122871",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#-- target: any 90+ days delinquent--\n",
    "dq_num= pd.to_numeric(perf_2018[\"delinquency_status\"].replace({\"RA\": 99}), errors=\"coerce\")\n",
    "\n",
    "target= (\n",
    "    dq_num\n",
    "    .groupby(perf_2018[\"loan_id\"])\n",
    "    .max()\n",
    "    .ge(3)\n",
    "    .astype(int)\n",
    "    .reset_index(name=\"any_90_dpd\")\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "67321fb6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The category `RA` is defined in the dictionary as REO acquisition. These loans will be treated as 90+ days delinquent because REO acquisition reflects a severe default or foreclosure outcome. `zero_balance_code` will be useful because it tells why a loan was closed or terminated, but it will not be used as a predictor variable in the final model. It is retained for app interpretation and audit use."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "3eca4469",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#-- last observed termination code per loan--\n",
    "zero_bal= (\n",
    "    perf_2018[perf_2018[\"zero_balance_code\"].notna()]\n",
    "    .sort_values([\"loan_id\", \"report_period\"])\n",
    "    .groupby(\"loan_id\")[\"zero_balance_code\"]\n",
    "    .last()\n",
    "    .reset_index()\n",
    "    .rename(columns={\"zero_balance_code\": \"termin_code\"}))\n",
    "\n",
    "#-- joining--\n",
    "target= target.merge(zero_bal, on=\"loan_id\", how=\"left\")\n",
    "\n",
    "#-- fill loans with no observed termination event--\n",
    "target[\"termin_code\"]= target[\"termin_code\"].fillna(0)\n",
    "\n",
    "#-- final join--\n",
    "final_2018= or_2018.merge(target, on=\"loan_id\", how=\"inner\")\n",
    "\n",
    "#-- csv checkpoint--\n",
    "final_2018.to_csv(\"~/projects/data/homeloanadvisor/model_input_2018Q1.csv\", index=False)"
   ]
  },
